  leave things let me know in the comments  what you think we can get into book  spoilers if you want but please mark  those accordingly so they won't spoil  anyone else let me know what you're  looking forward to based on this trailer  and episode 4 and the rest of the season  in general please like this video if you  enjoyed it please subscribe to my  channel if you haven't already and  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon
 

